📈 Linear Regression Explained Simply: The Machine Learning Algorithm Every Beginner Should Learn
📖 Overview

This repository contains my beginner-friendly blog on Linear Regression, one of the fundamental supervised Machine Learning algorithms. The article explains the concepts from scratch using simple language, intuitive examples, visual diagrams, and optimization concepts.

Whether you're a student, aspiring Data Scientist, or preparing for Machine Learning interviews, this guide provides a strong conceptual foundation.

